{"id":454,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为了进一步提升课程考核的科学性与规范性，充分发挥考试的导向和检验作用，帮助学生巩固所学知识、提升学习成效，大学数学教学中心于3月10日下午在924会议室组织开展考试命题工作专题研讨。中心再次邀请李有文老师作报告，全院承担高等数学和线性代数课程的教师参加，由宋妮老师主持。</p><p>李老师立足AI时代的发展背景，从教学理念、考试理念、命题原则及命题流程四个维度展开了深入剖析。他结合详实的数据统计，重点阐述了如何通过精准把控核心知识点的覆盖广度来实现对学生能力的有效考核，并就如何评估各层次学生的得分预期，提出了具有实操性的建议与方法。在随后的研讨环节，与会教师结合自身命题实践中的困惑与难点进行了深入交流与讨论。</p><p>此次研讨通过经验分享与思维碰撞，为进一步规范考试命题工作、夯实本科教学质量基础提供了有力保障。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=fozNkZU8CiUmNboRR-PM4MfUlC4L4G7YL8CPMmv4L4A2nml0gihFp2hmCIa0USyankysokh2nlWVM4nfUz98LmVfLlUsnlCsnR-YoR7ZolWFUlLsnNC8MRWFMNlPolCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4CDL4vJqdVnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6637&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A0D78FEBE74AA8421A1D7EF7D228189B/AC7FF442/6E19F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 369px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=fM7CkDnRLbLz-4oRz9sMNVRoR7sn7l7ZnmUYLzf2U8UDLmN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyiL1yYUYyZnlQ7n7-Ynz62UmrfLl7snm7soRrfU4CDMmVFMzv8Lm7solQFMzVVL87YgtXaQ4Oeo4x4_dAbgDTJQty0Lz7aL1yDMmLsgtA8pUVcc&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6637&e=.jpg\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=fozNkDoR7DLz-DLR8r7oRfRMz74ol77PLzn2Um6knmLDMN70gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiUYyiUSybLNM7n7-ZM7W7nNVVM4LbLNl8LlU4ozrVn7rFnRvYn7-sLmVFMm9ZLmlJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4CDL4vJqdVnx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6637&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/25C5A92CDDB84BDFAE7392E41D395EDE/D72DB721/68825\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 369px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=fnmGkiU8QfUlUanRzUYM8CsU8LYLRU7Zo7Q2Lmv4LNCsM8U0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDMYhRLSyZMmTVMNlPLNl4MmlPnmM7LNW7oz7sMmGZM4AFLmffM7L4MmWFLNUDUNWRgtXaQ4Oeo4x4_dAbgDTJQty0Lz7aL1yDMmLsgtA8pUVcc&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=6637&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://math.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=fozNkZU8CiUmNboRR-PM4MfUlC4L4G7YL8CPMmv4L4A2nml0gihFp2hmCIa0USyankysokh2nlWVM4nfUz98LmVfLlUsnlCsnR-YoR7ZolWFUlLsnNC8MRWFMNlPolCJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4CDL4vJqdVnx&oid=1867244289